---
// Verbatim Authentic Content & Media from Khao Sok Riverside Cottages
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';

---

<PageLayout
  title="Dining at Riverside Cottages – Rafflesia Cafe"
  description="Thai & Western dishes at Rafflesia Cafe in Khao Sok, served by the River. Fresh ingredients and a relaxed jungle setting. Visitors welcome."
  heroImage="/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/rafflesia-cafe-khao-sok-restaurant-1.jpg"
  heroTitle="Dining at Riverside Cottages – Rafflesia Cafe"
  heroSubtitle="The Ancient Rainforest of Southern Thailand"
  breadcrumbs={[{"label": "Khao Sok Restaurant", "href": "/khao-sok-restaurant/"}]}
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-10">
    <div class="bg-[#faf8f5]/95 border border-[#12281b]/10 rounded-3xl p-4 sm:p-8 md:p-12 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-md">
      
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#12281b]/10 pb-4 mb-8 font-sans text-[11px] tracking-[0.2em] font-medium uppercase text-[#163824]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold">
          <span class="text-[#7a5813]">KSR</span>
          <span class="text-[#12281b]/20">/</span>
          <span>FIELD DISPATCH</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[#7a5813] font-bold">KHAO SOK · THAILAND</span>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-[#223e2c] text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-normal">

        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>A Place to Relax Beside the River</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Set next to the Sok River, Rafflesia Cafe is an integral part of the Riverside Cottages experience. It’s a place guests return to throughout the day — not just to eat, but to pause, unwind, and feel connected to the natural surroundings.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Across the river, a few meters away, monkeys often move through the trees and play along the riverbank. From time to time, canoes and river tubers drift past. The constant presence of the river and the surrounding forest creates a setting that is both calm and quietly engaging — somewhere many guests find themselves lingering far longer than planned.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Rafflesia cafe is open to all – hotel guests and visitors alike.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Food & Drink</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The menu at Rafflesia Cafe is designed to suit the relaxed rhythm of the day, with a mix of Thai dishes, Western favourites, and lighter options available from morning through to evening.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Breakfast leans towards familiar Western-style choices, which many guests appreciate before heading out on tours and activities. Throughout the day, the kitchen serves a broad selection of freshly prepared dishes, from simple snacks to more substantial meals.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Our menu includes a wide range of Thai and Western dishes, from light snacks and fresh fruit shakes to full meals and desserts.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Beverages: fresh fruit shakes, cold drinks, hot coffee and tea, iced coffee and tea</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Adult beverages: beer, wine, and a selection of cocktails</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Breakfast</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Snacks & appetizers</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Western cuisine</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Pizzas</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Salads</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
