            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Rice and fried rice</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Curries</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Stir Fries</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Fish dishes</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Desserts</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Many of the ingredients used in the kitchen are sourced locally, with fresh fruit, vegetables, and eggs coming from our own small farm. Bread is baked on site, adding to the fresh, homemade quality of the food.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Children are well catered for, with options such as spaghetti, chicken tenders, and fries, and there are vegetarian and vegan options.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The focus is on good, satisfying food — whether you’re stopping briefly or settling in for a longer, more relaxed meal.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Browse our menu and open the full version for a closer look.
        </p>
